<title>USA: A.M. Best affirms &quot;A-&quot; for Connecticut Blue Cross.</title>
<headline>A.M. Best affirms &quot;A-&quot; for Connecticut Blue Cross.</headline>
<dateline>OLDWICK, N.J. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.M. Best Co on Thursday affirmed its &quot;A-&quot; (excellent) rating for Blue Cross &amp; Blue Shield of Connecticut Inc.</p>
<p>Best cited Blue Cross &amp; Blue Shield's 28 percent market share in Connecticut, its focus on managed care, its liquidity profile, adequate capitalization and recent improvements in net income.</p>
</text>
